      "placeholders" : [
        "F_Navi(\"Church\",\"hugel,159,113\")",
        ".@str$"
      ],
      "text" : "[Hugel Guide Granny]\nWell, to me, this {0} is rather like a place for old folks like me, you know...\n{1}"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 40,
      "npc" : "Hugel Guide Granny",
      "placeholders" : [
        "F_Navi(\"Inn\",\"hugel,101,77\")",
        ".@str$"
      ],
      "text" : "[Hugel Guide Granny]\nPudding rather than praise.\nYou'd better unpack your stuff at the {0} first before you start looking around this village.\n{1}"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 48,
      "npc" : "Hugel Guide Granny",
      "placeholders" : [
        "F_Navi(\"Pub\",\"hugel,126,65\")",
        ".@str$"
      ],
      "text" : "[Hugel Guide Granny]\nYes, when you travel, you want to drop by a {0} and make new friends.\nGo east from here, then you will arrive at the pub.\n{1}"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 56,
      "npc" : "Hugel Guide Granny",
      "placeholders" : [
        "F_Navi(\"Airport\",\"hugel,178,146\")",
        ".@str$"
      ],
      "text" : "[Hugel Guide Granny]\nA while ago, strangers came to the village and built that strange {0} kind of thing...\nWhat do they call it? Airship?\n{1}"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 64,
      "npc" : "Hugel Guide Granny",
      "placeholders" : [
        "F_Navi(\"Weapon Shop\",\"hugel,88,167\")",
        ".@str$"
      ],
      "text" : "[Hugel Guide Granny]\nWell, we have a {0} in the center of the village.\nBut I don't know if there is any weapon that you find useful.\n{1}"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 72,
      "npc" : "Hugel Guide Granny",
      "placeholders" : [
        "F_Navi(\"Tool Shop\",\"hugel,92,163\")",
        ".@str$"
      ],
      "text" : "[Hugel Guide Granny]\nYes, I love Hugel brand Red Potions. I haven't tasted Red Potions from any other brands yet...hohoho. \nThe {0} is located in the center of village.\n{1}"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 80,
      "npc" : "Hugel Guide Granny",
      "placeholders" : [
        "F_Navi(\"Bingo Game Room\",\"hugel,58,206\",\"^800080\")",
        ".@str$"
      ],
      "text" : "[Hugel Guide Granny]\nI will mark the location\nof the {0}\non your mini-map.\n{1}"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 89,
      "npc" : "Hugel Guide Granny",
      "placeholders" : [
        "F_Navi(\"Hunter Guild\",\"hugel,209,224\")",
        ".@str$"
      ],
      "text" : "[Hugel Guide Granny]\nOh, are you an aspiring Hunter?\nThen head northeast following the beach, then you will find the {0}.\n{1}"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 97,
      "npc" : "Hugel Guide Granny",
      "placeholders" : [
        "F_Navi(\"Party Supplies Shop\",\"hugel,95,103\",\"^483D8B\")",
        ".@str$"
      ],
      "text" : "[Hugel Guide Granny]\nI will mark the location\nof the {0}\non your mini-map.\n{1}"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 106,
      "npc" : "Hugel Guide Granny",
      "placeholders" : [
        "F_Navi(\"Shrine Expedition\",\"hugel,52,95\")",
        ".@str$"
      ],
      "text" : "[Hugel Guide Granny]\nI heard that the \n{0} is staying in a house at the west.\nThey have put some kind of sign in the middle of village, so I guess that they are hiring people for something...\nI wonder what they are doing in here... hmmm.\n{1}"
    },
